93	Sentences were encoded using byte-pair encoding [3], which has a shared source-\ntarget vocabulary of about 37000 tokens. For English-French, we used the signiﬁcantly larger WMT\n2014 English-French dataset consisting of 36M sentences and split tokens into a 32000 word-piece\nvocabulary [31]. Sentence pairs were batched together by approximate sequence length. Each training\nbatch contained a set of sentence pairs containing approximately 25000 source tokens and 25000\ntarget tokens.\n5.2\nHardware and Schedule\nWe trained our models on one machine with 8 NVIDIA P100 GPUs. For our base models using\nthe hyperparameters described throughout the paper, each training step took about 0.4 seconds. We\ntrained the base models for a total of 100,000 steps or 12 hours.	{"type": "text", "page": 7, "source": "attention.pdf", "_node_content": "{\\"id_\\": \\"1b0a8462-7510-46f6-a15c-8b90f1285cdb\\", \\"embedding\\": null, \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 7, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\"}, \\"excluded_embed_metadata_keys\\": [], \\"excluded_llm_metadata_keys\\": [], \\"relationships\\": {\\"1\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"0e902346-b83a-4454-9364-885546db8d7c\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"4\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 7, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"5c63254d65b0855b33f15154f99ebf6c19fcf9faa76ab3e5228c1da2c24a237b\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"2\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"48f40de3-1576-49fa-8af1-cc2d36eb146c\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 7, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"dd549390bc2a5c2cfc6e52e4d00f743ceca32c744894f3262c45c1c83684e399\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"3\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"9f7dc3e0-3b2c-4b5e-9008-f7cb681e3ad6\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {}, \\"hash\\": \\"0f0bac9f8e08fd6c37c409083a1cbd7f4ec3d5f111f9bd63b6d3109076e474a6\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}}, \\"metadata_t