94	We\ntrained the base models for a total of 100,000 steps or 12 hours. For our big models,(described on the\nbottom line of table 3), step time was 1.0 seconds. The big models were trained for 300,000 steps\n(3.5 days).\n5.3\nOptimizer\nWe used the Adam optimizer [17] with β1 = 0.9, β2 = 0.98 and ϵ = 10−9.	{"type": "text", "page": 7, "source": "attention.pdf", "_node_content": "{\\"id_\\": \\"9f7dc3e0-3b2c-4b5e-9008-f7cb681e3ad6\\", \\"embedding\\": null, \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 7, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\"}, \\"excluded_embed_metadata_keys\\": [], \\"excluded_llm_metadata_keys\\": [], \\"relationships\\": {\\"1\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"0e902346-b83a-4454-9364-885546db8d7c\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"4\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 7, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"5c63254d65b0855b33f15154f99ebf6c19fcf9faa76ab3e5228c1da2c24a237b\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"2\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"1b0a8462-7510-46f6-a15c-8b90f1285cdb\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 7, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"cbff400827ce5651a5e8f5df4179b27f37cf6a45f7f28c82e9adcb63d73624b4\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"3\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"839a08cb-e73e-4827-832f-f32f8e84ad92\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {}, \\"hash\\": \\"5dc559df5ea0d87f2df2e5b4480229a7381c36bdf1a1c11a3262dead13a0a073\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}}, \\"metadata_template\\": \\"{key}: {value}\\", \\"metadata_separator\\": \\"\\\\n\\", \\"text\\": \\"\\", \\"mimetype\\": \\"text/plain\\", \\"start_char_idx\\": 2164, \\"end_char_idx\\": 2464, \\"text_template\\": \\"{metadata_str}\\\\n\\\\n{content}\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"TextNode\\"}", "_node_type": "TextNode", "document_id": "0e902346-b83a-4454-9364-885546db8d7c", "doc_id": "0e902346-b83a-4454-9364-885546db8d7c", "ref_doc_id": "0e902346-b83a-4454-9364-885546db8d7c"}	9