99	4\n41.0\n2.3 · 1019\nLabel Smoothing\nDuring training, we employed label smoothing of value ϵls = 0.1 [30]. This\nhurts perplexity, as the model learns to be more unsure, but improves accuracy and BLEU score.\n6\nResults\n6.1\nMachine Translation\nOn the WMT 2014 English-to-German translation task, the big transformer model (Transformer (big)\nin Table 2) outperforms the best previously reported models (including ensembles) by more than 2.0\nBLEU, establishing a new state-of-the-art BLEU score of 28.4. The conﬁguration of this model is\nlisted in the bottom line of Table 3. Training took 3.5 days on 8 P100 GPUs.	{"type": "text", "page": 8, "source": "attention.pdf", "_node_content": "{\\"id_\\": \\"7dcbb900-7f8b-4781-b56c-c8fc44d8a86d\\", \\"embedding\\": null, \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 8, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\"}, \\"excluded_embed_metadata_keys\\": [], \\"excluded_llm_metadata_keys\\": [], \\"relationships\\": {\\"1\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"eeab9166-40ed-44aa-bcaf-1cd836331d7d\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"4\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 8, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"28f8ae1d6d1e21e23575b32e2dfb6e375884faf4d4788ca5d0fdfef9bf4fcc41\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"2\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"83c60fb1-6124-4032-a500-a3e2daad5e6e\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {\\"type\\": \\"text\\", \\"page\\": 8, \\"source\\": \\"attention.pdf\\"}, \\"hash\\": \\"31e9f7e62a82e00544540829318d639ed8715a411e2f00dd36610d6337e4eab8\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}, \\"3\\": {\\"node_id\\": \\"70e7452e-06e2-4797-ac22-110c358293a6\\", \\"node_type\\": \\"1\\", \\"metadata\\": {}, \\"hash\\": \\"00e72158cfcb004448a7692848e3ab7502bbff79de754f42125baf177e72967f\\", \\"class_name\\": \\"RelatedNodeInfo\\"}}, \\"metadata_template\\": \\"{key}: {value}\\", \\"metadata_separator\\": \\"\\\\n\\", \\"text\\": \\"\\", \\"mimetype\\": \\"text/plain\\", \\"start_char_idx\\": 673